ue corresponde.","In my previous role, I coordinated contractors and improved response times by introducing a shared incident log.",["In my previous role, I coordinated contractors and improved response times by introducing a shared incident log.","There are no problems to solve.","This is a simple greeting."],0,"Escuchá el mensaje completo."],["dictation","Transcribí la oración que escuchás.","In my previous role, I coordinated contractors and improved response times by introducing a shared incident log.","Comprobá la ortografía y las formas verbales."],["order","Reconstruí la oración.","In my previous role, I coordinated contractors and improved response times by introducing a shared incident log.","Mantené el sentido y la puntuación."],["write","Redactá un resumen de al menos 35 palabras e incluí una limitación, un riesgo o una recomendación razonada.",{"min":35,"must":[],"model":"The text describes a relevant situation and presents a limitation. A careful decision should consider the available evidence before reaching a final conclusion."},"Una síntesis B2 debe diferenciar afirmaciones, razones y límites."],["write","Escribí una respuesta profesional de al menos 30 palabras con una propuesta o pregunta aclaratoria.",{"min":30,"must":[],"model":"Thank you for sharing this information. Before making a decision, I would like to clarify the main risks and available evidence. We could review the next steps together."},"Una respuesta profesional propone un siguiente paso concreto."],["speak","Explicá la idea principal y una precaución usando inglés natural.","In my previous role, I coordinated contractors and improved response times by introducing a shared incident log.","Practicá énfasis, pausas y conectores."]]}
